WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.140
opinions and not get interrupted. So for

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:02.860
me personally I tend to

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:04.459
kind of call out let&#x27;s say the other

00:00:04.459 --> 00:00:08.300
person. Um because I think in my home or

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.459
relationship dynamic it&#x27;s just a lot of

00:00:10.459 --> 00:00:11.660
just self-awareness because a lot of

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:13.019
people don&#x27;t know they&#x27;re interrupting

00:00:13.019 --> 00:00:15.660
others, right? So sometimes it&#x27;s like,

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:17.019
&quot;Okay, yeah, hold your thought. Just

00:00:17.019 --> 00:00:18.860
like hold on for like 30 more seconds or

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:20.700
however long. Just like let this person

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:22.860
finish their spiel.&quot; And it&#x27;s funny,

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:25.260
people don&#x27;t tend to have a good um

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:27.099
signal because I&#x27;ve had multiple

00:00:27.099 --> 00:00:28.940
