00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:30.220
he&#x27;s like, &quot;Oh, I thought you were

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:32.860
done.&quot; I&#x27;m like, &quot;No, that pause was not

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:34.620
long enough in my point, but they

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:36.140
interpreted as a different

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:38.220
These these are exactly the types of

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:39.819
things that like I&#x27;ve run into in my

00:00:39.819 --> 00:00:41.420
