00:00:41.420 --> 00:00:43.099
way for us to have a common language

00:00:43.099 --> 00:00:44.860
about those pains or at least some way

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:47.580
to remind us and not be punitive, but

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.420
just have some way to be like,

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:51.180
this is how I talk and these are sort of

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:52.459
my break points or these are where I

00:00:52.459 --> 00:00:53.900
would like to jump in or something like

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:54.299
that.

00:00:54.299 --> 00:00:54.800
Right. Right.
